abstract: "edit-reel is an autonomous, zero-interaction open-source AI video editor and auto subtitles generator for 9:16 vertical short-form video (Instagram Reels, TikTok, and YouTube Shorts). It integrates acoustic word-boundary silence removal via Faster-Whisper, MediaPipe AI vision person segmentation, tactile physical motion graphics on warm paper canvas, and -11.5 LUFS broadcast audio mastering."
